A few things have happened that seem to be new in 3.1.3 that are
rather surprising...(to me anyway)

I picked up Demonbane in a bones level today.  This, I thought,
wasn't permitted.  In 3.1.2 this would have turned into a long
sword.  Do all artifacts remain intact now on a bones level, or
just certain ones? (can I die with PYEC and get it back on a bones
level?)

Also, I entered level 10 as a Knight (first time playing, I don't
know why everyone thinks Knights are so hard to play), and I found
the level to be completely lit, devoid of obstacles (no walls), and
a smattering of objects and monsters.  I have never seen a level like
this, and there was no special name attributed to it either.  Is this
something new in 3.1.3, have I been incredibly (un)lucky not to find
it until now, or do all Knights get a level like this?
